Okay, with a name like Indiana I can only assume you're playing an 
archaeologist.  To get into atlantis you need to get to level 14 and
talk to your quest leader, who will open the magic portal to transport
you there.  _Make Sure You Have An Amulet Of Magical Breathing!_  If
you don't you'll drown in Atlantis.  Wander (or, well, swim) around until
you find your quest enemy.  Kill him and get the quest artifact, the
Orb of Detection.  Then go back to the main dungeon, and continue on
your descent.

